<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/doi-10-1162-imag-a-00032> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributed_to> _:rfddbccaa77e19bdbb20eae14_ndcdfb43d0a3c4f61acfe6104cbdd2155b7 .
