_:r45d6d652fe2d6ca5a2142b54_n420aac14f2bb4e8797645c327da44a48b6 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "Six problems for causal inference from fMRI" .
_:r45d6d652fe2d6ca5a2142b54_n420aac14f2bb4e8797645c327da44a48b7 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#predicate> <http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/locator> .
