_:r5b350d198f6a727c73da4b28_n926dd021db5946a6ad80151f0ade4828b10 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "The PyMVPA BIDS-App: a robust multivariate pattern analysis pipeline for fMRI data" .
_:r5b350d198f6a727c73da4b28_n926dd021db5946a6ad80151f0ade4828b11 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#predicate> <http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/locator> .
