_:re0e979142d8bcd9ab0c072d5_nf3caa463269b4d80acc77d6b3e091ff8b12 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#predicate> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> .
